# Task States Test

Tests all task state types: open, done, in-progress, waiting, cancelled.


## Basic Task States

[ ] Open task - not started yet
[x] Done task - completed
[@] In-progress task - currently working on this
[w] Waiting task - blocked or on hold
[~] Cancelled task - no longer needed


## Nested Task States

[ ] Parent open task
    [ ] Child open task
    [x] Child done task
    [@] Child in-progress task
    [w] Child waiting task
    [~] Child cancelled task


## Mixed States with Comments

[ ] Task with single-line comment
    /// This is a single-line comment
[@] In-progress task with multi-line comment
    This is the first line of multi-line comment.
    This is the second line.
    
    This is the fourth line (third line is empty).
[x] Completed task with timestamp #done:2026-02-15_10:30:00
[~] Cancelled task with reason #done:2026-02-14_16:45:00
    /// Cancelled because requirements changed


## Deep Nesting

[ ] Level 1 task
    [ ] Level 2 task
        [ ] Level 3 task
            [ ] Level 4 task
                [ ] Level 5 task
                    [x] Level 6 completed task
